  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tax Modernisation Programme Grant &#x2013; Corporate Plan 4</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the efficiency, effectiveness and fairness of Tanzania&#x2019;s tax administration system through the provision of financial and technical assistance, resulting in increased revenue of approximately Tsh 10,901 billion (&#xA3;4.3 billion) over the 5 year period.  This will enable the Government of Tanzania to deliver higher quality and more rapid results in priority areas such as water, education, agriculture, transportation and energy.  It will also help scale up the Government&#x2019;s cash transfer programme to benefit approximately 7 million people per annum by 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
